  "porchandparty": {
    "_about": "Porch & Party Studio, matched to porchandparty901.com: warm linen ground, a terracotta accent (the site's button colour, darkened one step to #aa5c40 so white text on it reads 4.9:1), dusty rose for the tag line and small flourishes, a warm cocoa sidebar. Cormorant Garamond headings and Inter body as on the site; the wordmark in Great Vibes, the site's logo script. Alarms stay a true crimson (--danger) so the terracotta accent is never read as one (make-it-calm: red is a real alarm only).",
    "fonts": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Great+Vibes&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap",
